WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.000
- I have to ask though,
I saw this picture online

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.590
and I'm just wondering
if you were just going

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.710
for the Tom Selleck thing
or this was for "Mario,"

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.610
what's happening here in this picture?

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.300
- That's New Year's.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.220
I grew out my mustache for something

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:19.200
that I was doing, I'd like
to say that I grew it out

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.033
to do the voice.

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:21.589
- You were very method.

00:00:21.589 --> 00:00:22.422
Very method.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:23.255
- Deep into the character.

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:24.800
- Like what would it feel like?

00:00:25.719 --> 00:00:26.552
- You just guys do music.

00:00:26.552 --> 00:00:28.620
You know how the mustache
affects the sounds.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.470
- Oh, definitely.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.710
- Does that make it rock more, Jack?

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.082
- I'm not talking to you guys.

00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:34.110
(audience and panel laughing)

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.400
But I thought it looked a little more

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.870
like a three musketeer.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.880
- I was going D'Artagnan all day long.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.257
- [Jack] Mario doesn't have
the soul patch downstairs,

00:00:41.257 --> 00:00:42.090
you know?

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:42.923
- You were working you were working

00:00:42.923 --> 00:00:43.756
almost a full Vandyke there.

00:00:43.756 --> 00:00:45.453
- Actually all of y'all
in a musketeer movie

00:00:45.453 --> 00:00:46.870
would be amazing.

00:00:48.237 --> 00:00:49.742
- The three musketeers-

00:00:49.742 --> 00:00:52.353
- Yeah, this would be amazing actually.

